# Pairs with TypeOK. The type invariant rejects an activation state outside the lifecycle.
MODULE: DeactivationEndsInUnknownState
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a finished deactivation leaves the activation in a state it does not have
PERTURBS: FinishDeactivation

--- FIND
    /\ ~Running(l)
    /\ dep' = [dep EXCEPT ![l] = "live"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~Running(l)
    \* MUTATION: an unknown activation state
    /\ dep' = [dep EXCEPT ![l] = "collected"]
--- END
